OL,3,GNEWSARiding instructor returns to work
OL,4,Aafter paralysis
OL,5,
OL,6,F"One of the things that has motivated
OL,7,Fme to get out of bed and defy my
OL,8,Fexpectations, or consultant's
OL,9,Fexpectations, is my passion for working
OL,10,Fwith horses and ponies," she said.
